Dear all,

For those who don't follow the higher-traffic mailing lists and  
newsgroups.

The LaTeX3 Team is pleased to announce the first status update for the  
LaTeX3 Project. As work progresses on the LaTeX3 codebase, we plan on  
making twice-yearly updates covering the work we've done and the work  
we're doing.

If you've been following along with some of the recent discussions  
here, it won't come as such a surprise that stuff has been happening :)

More details on the LaTeX3 news page: <http://www.latex-project.org/l3news/ 
 >

Happy TeX-ing,
The LaTeX3 Team
